				note = "{quest:98342} (Tauren) waits on the hill above the bridge in southern {area:493}; the {npc:272054} (Skyborne) stands on high ground past the twin bridges, south-west of {area:2361}: climb up to it. The relics lie in the {area:2363} east of the lake: leave your form and click the statue at the den's entrance for a short stealth (five minutes), then go deep into the cave and over the bridge. Enraged spirits guard the relics and attack anything they see: stay in the statue's stealth and keep moving. Each relic is a small orb beside a cat statue in an alcove: the Fang and the Claw have one spot each, the Silent Shadow two, and it is the one players camp. A relic shows as unusable while another player loots it: wait a moment and try again. Stealth gone? Walk back to the entrance statue for more.",
