			["Cast {spell:18960} and see {npc:11802}, then take {npc:11800}'s flight from the middle of {area:2361} (she flies druids to {area:702}, no flight path needed) and the portal up to {zone:1457}. {npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed) and the portal up to Darnassus. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.",
