			["Use the {item:15826} on living {npc:12298} (level 5, a green cloud over them): they roam {zone:1439} from the {area:456} to the {zone:1440} border, many around the Blackwood furbolg camp north-east of {area:442}. Druid trick: root a deer with {spell:339}, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time. Lost a dose on a deer that did not count? Abandon the quest and take it again from {npc:3702} for a fresh salve."] = "Use the Curative Animal Salve on living Sickly Deer (level 5, a green cloud over them): they roam Darkshore from the Cliffspring River to the Ashenvale border, many around the Blackwood furbolg camp north-east of Auberdine. Druid trick: root a deer with Entangling Roots, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time. Lost a dose on a deer that did not count? Abandon the quest and take it again from Alanndarian for a fresh salve.",
		},
		zone = 1450,
		zoneName = "Moonglade",
	}
end)

