nd 2 Advanced Target Dummies) or Goblin Engineering (Nixx Sprocketspring, Gadgetzan: 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 Solid Dynamite and 5 Explosive Sheep). The Accurate Scope schematic now binds when picked up, but the quest takes a scope someone else made. The membership card lasts 14 days of play; renewing it costs 2g. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby.",
		},
		zone = 947,
		zoneName = "Azeroth",
	}
end)

