		written = {
			["Normal Scourge outside the dungeons stop giving reputation halfway through Friendly (3,000 of 6,000); {npc:10826}, {npc:10821} and {npc:10825} stop at the end of Friendly. After that only Araj, the {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, the cauldron deliveries and Scourgestones count. Now turn in the stones you saved: {npc:11039} at {area:2268} takes all three kinds, and so do the officers at {area:3197} and the {area:152}. Every turn-in pays 25 and an {item:12844}: keep 35 tokens for the mantles at Revered and Exalted. {quest:5509} are worth twice as much per stone: the Dark Adepts, Shadowmages, Dread Weavers and Scourge Champions (level 58-60) at {area:2272}, just north of {area:2268}, drop them about a third of the time or more, next to the turn-in. The named Scourge below drop a {item:12843} half the time or more ({npc:1850} two times in three, Araj and {npc:10821} half the time) and give 15 a kill, Araj until Exalted; {npc:1850} gives no reputation, only the stone. Friendly opens the Enriched Manna Biscuits (60 silver) at the quartermasters."] = "Normal Scourge outside the dungeons stop giving reputation halfway through Friendly (3,000 of 6,000); Lord Darkscythe, Hed'mush and Gish stop at the end of Friendly. After that only Araj, the Scholomance and Stratholme mobs, the cauldron deliveries and Scourgestones count. Now turn in the stones you saved: Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel takes all three kinds, and so do the officers at Chillwind Camp and the Bulwark. Every turn-in pays 25 and an Argent Dawn Valor Token: keep 35 tokens for the mantles at Revered and Exalted. Invader's Scourgestones are worth twice as much per stone: the Dark Adepts, Shadowmages, Dread Weavers and Scourge Champions (level 58-60) at Northdale, just north of Light's Hope Chapel, drop them about a third of the time or more, next to the turn-in. The named Scourge below drop a Corruptor's Scourgestone half the time or more (Putridius two times in three, Araj and Hed'mush half the time) and give 15 a kill, Araj until Exalted; Putridius gives no reputation, only the stone. Friendly opens the Enriched Manna Biscuits (60 silver) at the quartermasters.",
			["{quest:5212} leads to {quest:5213} (the {item:13176} in a {area:2279} ziggurat), which rewards the {item:13209} or the {item:19812}: better trinkets that also make Scourgestones drop, so they can replace the Commission. {quest:5251} leads on to the {item:13250} and {npc:10440}. A {item:13920}, a rare drop (about 6%) from the {quest:5529} once {quest:5529} is done, starts a quest worth 50 each time: keep them until Revered. {npc:10267} in the {zone:1428}, at the end of her {area:1583} quests, sends you to {npc:243252} (75) and on to {npc:11035}'s {item:12368} in {area:2057} (25 and 200)."] = "The Flesh Does Not Lie leads to The Active Agent (the Scourge Data in a Stratholme ziggurat), which rewards the Seal of the Dawn or the Rune of the Dawn: better trinkets that also make Scourgestones drop, so they can replace the Commission. The Archivist leads on to the Head of Balnazzar and Baron Rivendare. A Healthy Dragon Scale, a rare drop (about 6%) from the Plagued Hatchlings once Plagued Hatchlings is done, starts a quest worth 50 each time: keep them until Revered. Tinkee Steamboil in the Burning Steppes, at the end of her Blackrock Spire quests, sends you to Leonid Barthalomew (75) and on to Betina's Dawn's Gambit in Scholomance (25 and 200).",
		},
		zone = 1422,
		zoneName = "Western Plaguelands",
	}
end)

