		},
		title = "Brood of Nozdormu Reputation",
		version = 1,
		why = "The Bronze Dragonflight's ring, upgraded at every standing; a long climb from Hated, mostly in raids.",
		written = {
			["Back to {npc:11811}"] = "Back to Narain",
			["{npc:8125} wants 20 {item:9061} and 20 {item:8150} with the meat. {npc:11811} then wants 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 {item:18562}, 10 Azerothian Diamonds and 10 Blue Sapphires, and gives you an {item:21136}: placed at the {object:180669} in {zone:1447}'s {area:1227}, it calls up {npc:15571}, a level 63 boss for a raid. {npc:15571} drops the {item:21137} for one raider on the quest each kill."] = "Dirge wants 20 Goblin Rocket Fuel and 20 Deeprock Salt with the meat. Narain then wants 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 Elementium Ore, 10 Azerothian Diamonds and 10 Blue Sapphires, and gives you an Arcanite Buoy: placed at the Swirling Maelstrom in Azshara's Bay of Storms, it calls up Maws, a level 63 boss for a raid. Maws drops the Blue Scepter Shard for one raider on the quest each kill.",
			["{npc:8125}'s Chops"] = "Dirge's Chops",
			["{object:180717}"] = "The Scarab Gong",
			["{object:180717} hangs before the gates of {area:3428}. {npc:15693} appears beside it once the gong has been rung, with {quest:8745}: a weapon and 200 reputation."] = "The Scarab Gong hangs before the gates of Ahn'Qiraj. Jonathan the Revelator appears beside it once the gong has been rung, with Treasure of the Timeless One: a weapon and 200 reputation.",
			["{quest:8606} sends you, disguised with {npc:11811}'s turban, to a drop-off point south of {area:2255} in {zone:1452}. Leave the bag of gold there: {npc:15554}, a level 61 elite, comes for it (group of 3 to 5)."] = "Decoy! sends you, disguised with Narain's turban, to a drop-off point south of Everlook in Winterspring. Leave the bag of gold there: Number Two, a level 61 elite, comes for it (group of 3 to 5).",
			["{quest:8620} needs the eight chapters of {quest:8597}, Volume II: from {npc:15552} in his house on {area:2079} (a level 63 elite with guards, raid), the Felguard Elites, Doomguard Commanders and Dreadlords of the {zone:1419}, the Hederine south of {area:2255}, and a book in the {zone:1458}. {npc:11811} hands out the binding when you accept."] = "The Only Prescription needs the eight chapters of Draconic for Dummies, Volume II: from Doctor Weavil in his house on Alcaz Island (a level 63 elite with guards, raid), the Felguard Elites, Doomguard Commanders and Dreadlords of the Blasted Lands, the Hederine south of Everlook, and a book in the Undercity. Narain hands out the binding when you accept.",
			["{zone:1425} portal"] = "The Hinterlands portal",
		},
		zone = 1451,
		zoneName = "Silithus",
	}
end)

