				note = "Both quartermasters sell the same 12 recipes for {quest:93224}, no standing needed: {item:273613} and - Lesser Healing Power; Greater Spellblasting and {item:250941}; {item:250538} and {item:250606} plans; {item:252462}, {item:253973}, {item:10011} and {item:274490} patterns; the {item:269900} and {item:269902} schematics. Keep the totems you need for them before you hand the rest in.",
				title = "The totem recipes",
			},
		},
		title = "Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation",
		version = 1,
		why = "{zone:1443}'s feuding clans, reworked in Forever: pick one, buy its friendship, and trade totems for recipes.",
		written = {
			["At Honored and level 35, {npc:5397} sends you east to {npc:253177}, a Gelkis scout at the western mouth of the {quest:93034}, where the south of {zone:1443} runs into {zone:2652}. The valley steps follow Forever's quest data: nobody who records their play has done these quests yet, so a spot or the order may be off. Every valley quest asks you to stay Honored with the Gelkis, and each costs the Magram five times what it pays. Honored to Revered is 12,000; the valley pays 10,625 of it, {quest:92811} the rest."] = "At Honored and level 35, Uthek sends you east to Nerlokh, a Gelkis scout at the western mouth of the Valley of Bones, where the south of Desolace runs into Shen'dralas. The valley steps follow Forever's quest data: nobody who records their play has done these quests yet, so a spot or the order may be off. Every valley quest asks you to stay Honored with the Gelkis, and each costs the Magram five times what it pays. Honored to Revered is 12,000; the valley pays 10,625 of it, Economic Warfare the rest.",
			["Back to {npc:5397}, then east to the {zone:1435}: {quest:1373} (level 37) waits by a black cauldron in {area:76}, north-east of {area:75}."] = "Back to Uthek, then east to the Swamp of Sorrows: Ongeku (level 37) waits by a black cauldron in Fallow Sanctuary, north-east of Stonard.",
			["From the quest data: back west to {npc:5397} in {area:606}. She needs Tears of Theradras: {npc:253713}, the Voice of Theradras, keeps them in the cave in the south of the village, past {npc:253140}. Ask her for them on {npc:5397}'s behalf and bring three back. {npc:253140} takes {quest:92812} on the way."] = "From the quest data: back west to Uthek in Gelkis Village. She needs Tears of Theradras: Mulara, the Voice of Theradras, keeps them in the cave in the south of the village, past Molkar. Ask her for them on Uthek's behalf and bring three back. Molkar takes Economic Warfare on the way.",
			["From the quest data: {npc:253177} gives you a {item:255941} to show {npc:5397}, with an {item:255945} you find yourself: a freshly cursed skull, hoarded in the jaws of one of the valley's giant skeletons. The game's data has no spot for it."] = "From the quest data: Nerlokh gives you a Gelkis Necromantic Garb to show Uthek, with an Accursed Skull you find yourself: a freshly cursed skull, hoarded in the jaws of one of the valley's giant skeletons. The game's data has no spot for it.",
			["From the quest data: {npc:5397} gives you her staff and a {item:6071}. Put them together into {item:256061}, take it to the ritual site by the pond just east of the village and dispel the curse on the {item:255945}. Then east again to {npc:253177}."] = "From the quest data: Uthek gives you her staff and a Draenethyst Crystal. Put them together into Uthek's Draenethyst Staff, take it to the ritual site by the pond just east of the village and dispel the curse on the Accursed Skull. Then east again to Nerlokh.",
			["From the quest data: {npc:5601} (level 37) leads the Magram from the west side of {area:604}, north-east of {npc:253177}. The village is hostile to a friend of the Gelkis, and two Magram Necrokhans, elite and level 45, stand a little west of the khan. {npc:5397} pays 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: {item:271801} (two-handed axe: Strength, Stamina, Agility), {item:271802} (one-handed mace: Strength, Stamina, Agility) or {item:271805} (off-hand: Spirit, Intellect, Stamina). The quest costs the Magram 30,000."] = "From the quest data: Khan Jehn (level 37) leads the Magram from the west side of Magram Village, north-east of Nerlokh. The village is hostile to a friend of the Gelkis, and two Magram Necrokhans, elite and level 45, stand a little west of the khan. Uthek pays 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: Abandoned Ferocity (two-handed axe: Strength, Stamina, Agility), Bludgeon of Betrayed Virtues (one-handed mace: Strength, Stamina, Agility) or Thrice-Damned Effigy (off-hand: Spirit, Intellect, Stamina). The quest costs the Magram 30,000.",
			["Gelkis: {npc:5397} and {npc:253713}"] = "Gelkis: Uthek and Mulara",
			["Gelkis: {npc:5397} sends you to the valley"] = "Gelkis: Uthek sends you to the valley",
			["The Gelkis half starts with the clan's choice quest from the giver you just handed the totems to: {npc:5397}'s quests in {area:606} follow from it, and Buying Friendship alone does not open them."] = "The Gelkis half starts with the clan's choice quest from the giver you just handed the totems to: Uthek's quests in Gelkis Village follow from it, and Buying Friendship alone does not open them.",
			["{area:606}: {npc:5397} and {npc:253140}"] = "Gelkis Village: Uthek and Molkar",
		},
		zone = 1443,
		zoneName = "Desolace",
	}
end)

