		title = "Nightclaw Druids Reputation",
		version = 1,
		why = "{zone:2521}'s hidden druids: five cultist ears pay 1000 reputation, best done before you outlevel the isle.",
		written = {
			["Back to {npc:254151} inside the den. Ten ears for 1000 reputation and a green piece: leather gloves, cloth pants or mail boots. {npc:254151} then takes ears five at a time, for 1000 each, as often as you like, up to level 18; in Classic the pay drops from level 19 and is 200 from level 22. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "Back to Vayn inside the den. Ten ears for 1000 reputation and a green piece: leather gloves, cloth pants or mail boots. Vayn then takes ears five at a time, for 1000 each, as often as you like, up to level 18; in Classic the pay drops from level 19 and is 200 from level 22. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.",
			["The Al'Aketh Footsoldiers and Stormchasers camp just north of {npc:257944} and drop the Bloody Heirlooms (and ears, about one kill in four). The Shadowgale Shrieklings flying west of her drop the feathers; the {item:265105} grows on the trees along the stream west of her."] = "The Al'Aketh Footsoldiers and Stormchasers camp just north of Elegael and drop the Bloody Heirlooms (and ears, about one kill in four). The Shadowgale Shrieklings flying west of her drop the feathers; the Lady's Tear Moss grows on the trees along the stream west of her.",
			["The Nightfang Den is the cave north across the clearing from {npc:257944}. Heal the seven injured druids inside ({npc:258134} among them) and find {npc:258130}. {npc:253622} stands east of the den: he drops his head and a {quest:94490}; right-click the missive to start its quest."] = "The Nightfang Den is the cave north across the clearing from Elegael. Heal the seven injured druids inside (Naaleos Leafwhisper among them) and find Jorel Windsinger. Commander Haalien stands east of the den: he drops his head and a Ripped Missive; right-click the missive to start its quest.",
			["The storyline and {npc:254151}'s first quest leave you at Friendly with 2100 to spare. Honored is 3900 more: four turn-ins of five ears up to level 18, twenty from level 22. Friendly opens 32 of {npc:254151}'s patterns, in two colours, Cloudy and Azure: Blacksmithing Skyforged Wristguards and Chain (skill 50, 9s 50c), Gauntlets and Greaves (55, 11s); Leatherworking Gustwoven and Windraveled bracers and belts (50) and gloves and boots (55); Tailoring Stormsewn Cuffs and Cord (50), Handwraps and Shoes (55). They bind when you buy them, so buy them on the crafter."] = "The storyline and Vayn's first quest leave you at Friendly with 2100 to spare. Honored is 3900 more: four turn-ins of five ears up to level 18, twenty from level 22. Friendly opens 32 of Vayn's patterns, in two colours, Cloudy and Azure: Blacksmithing Skyforged Wristguards and Chain (skill 50, 9s 50c), Gauntlets and Greaves (55, 11s); Leatherworking Gustwoven and Windraveled bracers and belts (50) and gloves and boots (55); Tailoring Stormsewn Cuffs and Cord (50), Handwraps and Shoes (55). They bind when you buy them, so buy them on the crafter.",
			["ears for {npc:254151}: keep every one"] = "ears for Vayn: keep every one",
			["{npc:252359} stands in {area:16638}, the Skyborne town in the south of the isle, and has heard nothing from the druids up north. His errand is the start of the Nightclaw storyline (level 8 and up, any race). Every quest of it pays Nightclaw reputation: 4100 in all, enough for Friendly. Players' turn-ins paid their full reputation well above these quests' level."] = "Lotheluum stands in Valanaar, the Skyborne town in the south of the isle, and has heard nothing from the druids up north. His errand is the start of the Nightclaw storyline (level 8 and up, any race). Every quest of it pays Nightclaw reputation: 4100 in all, enough for Friendly. Players' turn-ins paid their full reputation well above these quests' level.",
			["{npc:252359} waits in {area:16638}. Hand in on your way to a skyboat or to the {area:16626}."] = "Lotheluum waits in Valanaar. Hand in on your way to a skyboat or to the Gustberry Lowlands.",
			["{npc:254151}'s patterns"] = "Vayn's patterns",
