		},
		title = "Steamwheedle Cartel Reputation",
		version = 1,
		why = "Every goblin town at once: {npc:14637}'s zapped giants and {npc:14338}'s shackles, then five new quartermasters and their hats.",
		written = {
			["Back to {npc:10267}"] = "Back to Tinkee",
			["Back to {npc:14637}"] = "Back to Zorbin",
			["Every goblin town at once: {npc:14637}'s zapped giants and {npc:14338}'s shackles, then five new quartermasters and their hats."] = "Every goblin town at once: Zorbin's zapped giants and Knot's shackles, then five new quartermasters and their hats.",
			["Five goblin towns share one reputation family, the Steamwheedle Cartel: {faction:470}, {faction:21}, {faction:369}, {faction:577} and Forever's new {faction:2827} in the {zone:2548}. Everyone starts each at Neutral (500 into it). A gain with one town gives the others half as much; a quest for the Cartel itself, like {npc:14637}'s, pays every town in full. Losses spread the same way: a {npc:4624} or any goblin of the towns costs 125 (half that with the other towns), and Bloodsail Buccaneers reputation is earned only that way. {npc:14637} camps on the road through central {zone:1444} and works for anyone, even players the goblins hate. His first two quests are level 48 and open his repeatables (level 55); Forever pays all of them in full at any level."] = "Five goblin towns share one reputation family, the Steamwheedle Cartel: Ratchet, Booty Bay, Gadgetzan, Everlook and Forever's new Powderfuse in the Riverglades. Everyone starts each at Neutral (500 into it). A gain with one town gives the others half as much; a quest for the Cartel itself, like Zorbin's, pays every town in full. Losses spread the same way: a Booty Bay Bruiser or any goblin of the towns costs 125 (half that with the other towns), and Bloodsail Buccaneers reputation is earned only that way. Zorbin camps on the road through central Feralas and works for anyone, even players the goblins hate. His first two quests are level 48 and open his repeatables (level 55); Forever pays all of them in full at any level.",
			["Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 240 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins, or 40 Free Knot runs, or a mix. Nothing can be saved up: residue and cores drop only while their quest is in your log, and you can carry one {item:18250} at a time, so hand each in before the next run. Honored opens each quartermaster's blue items."] = "Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 240 of Zorbin's turn-ins, or 40 Free Knot runs, or a mix. Nothing can be saved up: residue and cores drop only while their quest is in your log, and you can carry one Gordok Shackle Key at a time, so hand each in before the next run. Honored opens each quartermaster's blue items.",
			["From now on {npc:14637} offers {quest:7725} (10 residue) and {quest:7726} (6 cores), again and again: 25 reputation with every town each time."] = "From now on Zorbin offers Again With the Zapped Giants (10 residue) and Refuel for the Zapping (6 cores), again and again: 25 reputation with every town each time.",
			["Honored to Revered is 12,000 more: 480 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins (4,800 residue) or 80 Free Knot runs. Revered opens the five cosmetic hats, the reason most players do this. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "Honored to Revered is 12,000 more: 480 of Zorbin's turn-ins (4,800 residue) or 80 Free Knot runs. Revered opens the five cosmetic hats, the reason most players do this. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%.",
			["Neutral 500 to Friendly is 2,500 with each town. The quests above pay every town up to 700 ({npc:14637}'s two 300, {npc:10267}'s 150, the first Free Knot 150 and the first Ogre Suit 100); {npc:14637}'s repeatables do the rest, 25 to every town each: 10 residue (ten giants) or 6 cores (about twelve elementals). The towns' own quests count too, each giving the other towns half: {faction:470}'s in the {zone:1413} (levels 10-25, about 4,300: the Samophlange chain 625, {npc:3446}'s errands, the Wizzlecrank and Gilthares escorts 150 each), {faction:21}'s in Stranglethorn, Arathi and the {zone:1418} (30-50, about 6,500: the three OOX robot rescues 250 each, An OOX of Your Own 200, Stranglethorn Fever 200, Facing Negolash 200, the Sunken Treasure chain at {area:327}), {faction:369}'s in {zone:1446} (43-55, about 3,000: the {item:8548} 200, Wastewander Justice 100 each, the WANTED posters) and {faction:577}'s in {zone:1452} (52-60, about 1,450: {npc:9298}'s Winterfall chain, Umi's yeti quests). Forever adds a few low ones: A Simmering Storm and Stormy Potential in {zone:1411} and WANTED: Bruuz ({faction:470} 100 each), Important Heirlooms in {zone:1455} ({faction:369} 100). Forever pays them in full at any level. Kills help while they are not grey, 5 each: Southsea pirates in the {zone:1413} for {faction:470} and in {zone:1446} for {faction:369} and Stranglethorn's Venture Co. camps for {faction:21}, up to the end of Honored; Wastewander bandits for {faction:369} and Bloodsail pirates for {faction:21} only up to the end of Neutral. Friendly opens each quartermaster's first gear."] = "Neutral 500 to Friendly is 2,500 with each town. The quests above pay every town up to 700 (Zorbin's two 300, Tinkee's 150, the first Free Knot 150 and the first Ogre Suit 100); Zorbin's repeatables do the rest, 25 to every town each: 10 residue (ten giants) or 6 cores (about twelve elementals). The towns' own quests count too, each giving the other towns half: Ratchet's in the Barrens (levels 10-25, about 4,300: the Samophlange chain 625, Mebok Mizzyrix's errands, the Wizzlecrank and Gilthares escorts 150 each), Booty Bay's in Stranglethorn, Arathi and the Badlands (30-50, about 6,500: the three OOX robot rescues 250 each, An OOX of Your Own 200, Stranglethorn Fever 200, Facing Negolash 200, the Sunken Treasure chain at Faldir's Cove), Gadgetzan's in Tanaris (43-55, about 3,000: the Divino-matic Rod 200, Wastewander Justice 100 each, the WANTED posters) and Everlook's in Winterspring (52-60, about 1,450: Donova Snowden's Winterfall chain, Umi's yeti quests). Forever adds a few low ones: A Simmering Storm and Stormy Potential in Durotar and WANTED: Bruuz (Ratchet 100 each), Important Heirlooms in Ironforge (Gadgetzan 100). Forever pays them in full at any level. Kills help while they are not grey, 5 each: Southsea pirates in the Barrens for Ratchet and in Tanaris for Gadgetzan and Stranglethorn's Venture Co. camps for Booty Bay, up to the end of Honored; Wastewander bandits for Gadgetzan and Bloodsail pirates for Booty Bay only up to the end of Neutral. Friendly opens each quartermaster's first gear.",
			["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 more with each town: 840 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins or 140 Free Knot runs. No quartermaster sells anything for Exalted: this is for the title bar only."] = "Revered to Exalted is 21,000 more with each town: 840 of Zorbin's turn-ins or 140 Free Knot runs. No quartermaster sells anything for Exalted: this is for the title bar only.",
			["{quest:5525}: 150 to every town, handed in from {npc:14338}'s window"] = "Free Knot!: 150 to every town, handed in from Knot's window",
		},
		zone = 1444,
		zoneName = "Feralas",
	}
end)

