			["Carry a {item:17203} ({npc:11988}, the {area:2717}) to {npc:12944} and he offers you a contract: ask about the offer and take it. Handing in the contract with the ingot pays 200 reputation and {item:18592}, the hammer Blacksmiths later join with the {item:17204} into {item:17182}."] = "Carry a Sulfuron Ingot (Golemagg the Incinerator, the Molten Core) to Lokhtos and he offers you a contract: ask about the offer and take it. Handing in the contract with the ingot pays 200 reputation and Plans: Sulfuron Hammer, the hammer Blacksmiths later join with the Eye of Sulfuras into Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros.",
