			["Optional, and it saves every later trip to {npc:12944} the Ring of Law fight. {npc:8888} is a ghost in the middle of {area:1445}: only the dead see him, so die in the mountain and walk to his tomb as a spirit. He sends you after {npc:9056} in {area:1584}, who always drops {item:10999}; place it on {npc:8888}'s monument in the Shrine of Thaurissan and the {item:11000} falls out. {area:1584} is a five-player dungeon: group up."] = "Optional, and it saves every later trip to Lokhtos the Ring of Law fight. Franclorn Forgewright is a ghost in the middle of Blackrock Mountain: only the dead see him, so die in the mountain and walk to his tomb as a spirit. He sends you after Fineous Darkvire in Blackrock Depths, who always drops Ironfel; place it on Franclorn's monument in the Shrine of Thaurissan and the Shadowforge Key falls out. Blackrock Depths is a five-player dungeon: group up.",
