				note = "At Exalted your necklace takes its last upgrade, Rin'wosho sells {item:20013} (5g), and Rin'wosho trades 15 Zandalar Honor Tokens for one Signet of the Zandalar, the shoulder enchant: Might (attack power), Mojo (spell damage) or Serenity (healing).",
